OL,3,GNEWSADeveloper criticised over bid to
OL,4,Aditch school site
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe developer of a 750-homes scheme has
OL,7,Fbeen met with fierce opposition over
OL,8,Fits request to remove a new school site
OL,9,Ffrom its legal obligations.
OL,11,FVistry Homes is building new homes at
OL,12,FThe Tors in Callington Road, Tavistock,
OL,13,Fwith a school site included in its
OL,14,Foriginal planning agreement.
OL,16,FIt said Devon County Council had not
OL,17,Fformally requested the land transfer
OL,18,Ffor a school within the 10-year window
OL,19,Fsince planning permission was granted -
OL,20,Fand it therefore no longer had to form
OL,21,Fpart of the agreement.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
