OL,3,GNEWSADeveloper criticised over bid to
OL,4,Aditch school site
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a letter to West Devon Borough
OL,7,FCouncil regarding Vistry's application
OL,8,Ffor a modification of the planning
OL,9,Fagreement, Tavistock Town Council said
OL,10,Fthe removal of the school needed to be
OL,11,Fjustified.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
